; frame notches for the keyed stand feet (LAST)
; generated by jigsawzall/emitter.py
; left stock edge (x=0, X0 Y0 = the stock's bottom-left corner), 2 slots: one U each from the slot end to x=5, then 2mm slices alternating slot A / slot B out to x=-5
; if the head hits an end stop and aborts here, the puzzle is done: finish the remaining slot ends with a file, saw or knife
; SAME machine frame as the puzzle cut: run it on the same sheet without moving it
; quickcut: GRBL diode-laser cut, static M3, warmup on every path
; cut: ply3 100% (S1000 of 1000) F350 x1; warmup 1000ms = 5.8mm
; every cut: warmup wiggle (half the warmup out and back), then the passes;
; closed loops overlap the warmup distance past their start; middle-out order
;

